---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MoreProducts from '../components/MoreProducts.astro';
---
<Layout title="Cable Trays - Swastik Industries" current="products-sub">
<main><div class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/products/perforated-tray.webp" alt=""><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/products">Products</a> / Cable Trays</div><h1>Cable Trays</h1><p>Perforated and ladder type trays, customisable to the client's requirement.</p></div></div><section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="split "><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">Cable Management</div><h2>Perforated Cable Tray</h2><p class="lede">Perforated cable trays feature a continuous structural tray with a ventilated bottom containing uniformly spaced holes.</p><p class="lede">The perforations provide excellent ventilation for the cables, preventing heat buildup while still offering a solid, flat surface that securely supports smaller, flexible, or high-density instrumentation and control cables.</p>
<div class="tablewrap" style="width:100%"><table class="sched"><tbody><tr><td>Sheet Thickness</td><td class="v">1.6 mm to 3.0 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Length</td><td class="v">2.5 m or 3.0 m</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div><img src="/assets/products/perforated-tray.webp" alt="Perforated cable tray" loading="lazy"></div></div>
<div class="spec-row"><div class="matcard"><h3>Raw Material</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Mild steel</li><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Stainless steel</li><li>Aluminium</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Finish</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Hot dip galvanised</li><li>Powder coated</li><li>Painted</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Accessories</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Vertical outward bend</li><li>Horizontal bend</li><li>Vertical inward bend</li><li>Tee</li><li>Reducer</li><li>Cross</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="split flip"><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">Cable Management</div><h2>Ladder Type Cable Tray</h2><p class="lede">Ladder cable trays consist of two longitudinal side rails connected by individual transverse rungs, resembling a standard ladder.</p><p class="lede">This design provides maximum airflow and ventilation, allowing heat to dissipate rapidly from high-power cables. The rungs offer convenient anchor points for tying down heavy cables, and the open structure prevents dirt, dust, or moisture from accumulating inside the tray.</p>
<div class="tablewrap" style="width:100%"><table class="sched"><tbody><tr><td>Sheet Thickness</td><td class="v">1.6 mm to 3.0 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Length</td><td class="v">2.5 m or 3.0 m</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div><img src="/assets/products/ladder-tray.webp" alt="Ladder type cable tray" loading="lazy"></div></div>
<div class="spec-row"><div class="matcard"><h3>Raw Material</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Mild steel</li><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Stainless steel</li><li>Aluminium</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Finish</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Hot dip galvanised</li><li>Powder coated</li><li>Painted</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Accessories</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Vertical outward bend</li><li>Horizontal bend</li><li>Vertical inward bend</li><li>Tee</li><li>Reducer</li><li>Cross</li></ul></div></div></div></section><MoreProducts current="cable-trays" />
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Share Your Requirements with Us</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a Quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
